* LTspice Macro-model for HCNW4503 Optocoupler
* 5-Pin Configuration: Anode, Cathode, GND, VO, VCC
* Default CTR = 24% (Typical), hFE = 180 (Typical for Widebody)
.SUBCKT HCNW4503 A C GND VO VCC
.param CTR=0.24
.param hFE=180

* Input LED
D1 A N1 Dled
Vmeas N1 C 0V

* Photodiode transfer (Injects current from VCC to Base)
* It calculates the required base current based on CTR and hFE
B1 VCC B I=MAX(I(Vmeas),0)*(CTR/hFE)

* Output Transistor (NPN)
Q1 VO B GND Qout

* Convergence/Leakage resistor (Improves SPICE simulation stability)
Rbe B GND 1Meg

* Component Models
.model Dled D(Is=1e-15 N=1.9 Rs=2)
.model Qout NPN(Is=1e-14 Bf={hFE} Vaf=50)
.ENDS HCNW4503
